739179721_6426644903785558600_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wGPBpQqT3ewQ7kNvwGbBWwX&_nc_oc=AdoatMjmRxUYYigdIbTV27JwjkiMMDgQM-6DUBcNym75Aty7Fw7xzAnuTSPVM5YvOTc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQDtbrcXLXc8R_rvewVkUNYmqYCW_Qd8x6FFpwiXBwdaw&oe=6B0C7A32"}, {"file_name": "screenshoot-1 (5).png", "id": "29657657663859342", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654956704_29657657670526008_398550856735042625_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NeZRreuBAMwQ7kNvwH8UGYC&_nc_oc=AdrbujT9_BQx93-tWmZzKg-ULKFlu_urGJeqg8R1VyNf46ha34c4Q5s10cX_rmGI_KM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT7pfCaFRX55Mz7CqRPxT42Nf6aKxFVOEAj9zoFxShMPw&oe=6B0C82A5"}, {"file_name": "screenshoot-1 (6).png", "id": "1472373158323615", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303445_1472373161656948_2792800585242881888_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5mjWM10wgV8Q7kNvwFG8pyW&_nc_oc=AdqZyGOysB9Ra8WvGG_FB4aGR7qdJRNNYrpKc8OJNaaFvb1zrJXmXQVqkiy-z8tU-Tk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQn4jmPZH5ragwJMPQ4EUkhk3iVDZdbsa-PjMwQW1Ntkg&oe=6B0C7DE3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560px by 1440px.png", "id": "2686213901815053", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842236_2686213905148386_6243764749465323373_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zh6fejDO06IQ7kNvwFXgSbH&_nc_oc=AdrjmVNYCg4M2kQYJh9XjoLyzU6k_7wxsvcKJkzy9HjTWDel0rY9NBm_ImWYlNqfTrE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQo8W76OmUqmLKTLy49-mKL2nxjTzMhlStAVtiOD_cgEg&oe=6B0C79AE"}, "display_name": "Makeup Salon Simulator VR: Hair & Nails", "keywords": ["Makeupsalonsimulator", "SalonsimulatorvR", "Beautysalonsimulator", "Makeupgame", "Nailsalongame"], "long_description": "# MAKEUP SALON SIMULATOR VR: HAIR & NAILS\n\n## WELCOME TO YOUR VIRTUAL BEAUTY SALON\n\nStep into your own beauty studio and explore an immersive salon simulation made for Meta Quest. Serve customers, discover creative beauty activities and enjoy hands-on experiences in virtual reality.\n\n## HAIR SALON & BARBER SHOP\n\nGive customers fresh looks with haircuts, hairstyling, trimming, shaving and hair coloring. Explore different hairstyles and use barber tools to create unique appearances.\n\n## MAKEUP & BEAUTY STUDIO\n\nExperiment with lipstick, eyeshadow, mascara, brows, lashes and different cosmetic looks. Transform each customer's appearance and express your creativity through makeup.\n\n## NAIL SALON, MANICURE & PEDICURE\n\nCreate colorful nail designs with nail polish, acrylic nails, manicure and pedicure activities. Explore nail art and give every customer a distinctive style.\n\n## SKINCARE & SPA EXPERIENCE\n\nExplore skincare, facial care and spa-inspired beauty treatments in your virtual studio while creating a relaxing experience for your customers.\n\n## BUILD YOUR SALON EXPERIENCE\n\nWelcome customers, complete beauty services and enjoy running your virtual salon. From haircuts and makeup to nail art and skincare, discover a variety of activities in one beauty simulator.\n\n## START YOUR SALON JOURNEY IN VR\n\nReady to explore the world of beauty? Step into your virtual studio and enjoy a creative salon experience with Makeup Salon Simulator VR: Hair & Nails.", "short_description": "Enter a creative beauty studio in Makeup Salon Simulator VR! Explore makeup, experiment with hairstyles, and create nail designs in an immersive beauty salon game made for Meta Quest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/aeroversestudios/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aeroverse Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/aeroverse-studios/home", "catego